<section class="content">

<h3>6. Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus,<br />
you who climbed the mountain and opened your mouth<br />
to teach us the secret of happiness &mdash;<br />
help me to trust your beatitudes.<br />
<br />
When the world tells me that happiness is in having,<br />
remind me that it is in giving.<br />
When it tells me it is in power,<br />
remind me that it is in serving.<br />
When it tells me it is in pleasure,<br />
remind me that it is in loving.<br />
When it tells me it is in being admired,<br />
remind me that it is in being faithful.<br />
<br />
Make me poor in spirit like Chiara Luce,<br />
meek like St. Francis,<br />
merciful like Mother Teresa,<br />
pure in heart like the saints who see your face.<br />
<br />
You are the portrait the beatitudes paint.<br />
Make me into that image.<br />
Make me like You.<br />
<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>
</section>

